3. THE COLLECTIVE INTELLIGENCE OBLIGATION
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

This is the core obligation, and it is narrow on purpose.

  (a) PUBLISHED FORKS COME BACK. If you publicly distribute a modified
