      or an embedded copy, you must distribute it under this same
      license, state clearly that it is modified, and keep the
      attribution in Section 4. Improvements to a shared method belong
      to everyone who shares it.

  (b) PRIVATE USE CARRIES NO OBLIGATION. Modifying the Work for
      yourself, your team, or your employer, without publishing it,
      triggers nothing in this section. You may keep your changes
      private forever.

  (c) YOUR RECORDS ARE YOURS. Your profile, your memory files, your
      council log, your Parallax logs, and your workspace models are
      your property. Contributing any of them is an invitation, never a
      requirement, and no term of this license may be read as
      compelling disclosure of them.

  (d) CONSENT GOVERNS EVERY CONTRIBUTION. Anything you do choose to
      contribute travels under the consent rules built into the Work
      (PORTABLE_O.md section 7): anonymized, marked with its consent
      header, and released only on your explicit confirmation. This
      license never overrides those rules, and it never requires
      personal data, client data, or employer data to be shared. The
      obligation is to share improvements to the method, not
      information about people.

